WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.008 --> 00:00:16.203
The lamb was hopping and skipping.

2
00:00:16.204 --> 00:00:20.157
It did not see the fox.

3
00:00:20.158 --> 00:00:23.467
"We must warn Kep," Benjamin said.

4
00:00:23.468 --> 00:00:26.631
"Let's run across the field."

5
00:00:26.632 --> 00:00:29.176
Peter looked at the fox.

6
00:00:29.177 --> 00:00:34.397
He was creeping toward the lamb.

7
00:00:34.398 --> 00:00:37.738
"We don't have time," Peter said.

8
00:00:37.739 --> 00:00:41.146
Peter jumped out of the tall grass.

9
00:00:41.147 --> 00:00:45.823
"Tag!" he cried. "You're it!"

10
00:00:45.824 --> 00:00:49.642
"Baa!" the lamb cried happily.

11
00:00:49.643 --> 00:00:54.719
It skipped toward the bunnies.

12
00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.923
"Hey!" The fox yelled at Peter.

13
00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:11.698
"That lamb is my lunch!"

14
00:01:11.699 --> 00:01:17.480
Then the fox ran toward the bunnies.

15
00:01:17.481 --> 00:01:19.707
"I know," he said.

16
00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:30.758
"I'll eat rabbits for lunch!"

17
00:01:30.759 --> 00:01:37.105
Peter and Benjamin ran.

18
00:01:37.106 --> 00:01:41.508
They zigged and zagged through the field.

19
00:01:41.509 --> 00:01:44.894
They ran as fast as they could.

20
00:01:44.895 --> 00:01:49.777
But the fox ran fast too.

21
00:01:49.778 --> 00:01:53.751
Suddenly he leaped at Peter!

22
00:01:53.752 --> 00:01:59.310
"Ahh!" Peter cried.
